<Placemark><name>Quinta — Tătărași</name><description><![CDATA[15h00–18h00 · ≈ 3–4 km a pé dentro da zona · Autocarro/elétrico (~2,5 km da UAIC)
Ruas: Str. Vasile Lupu (eixo principal), Ruas comerciais paralelas
Alvos: Padarias e cafés de bairro, Salões e barbearias, Oficinas e serviços auto, Clínicas e farmácias independentes
Bairro residencial: negócios de clientela fixa, muitos só com Facebook. Argumento: aparecer no Google a quem se muda para o bairro.]]></description><styleUrl>#s3</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>27.604500,47.169839,0 27.605248,47.169817,0 27.605991,47.169750,0 27.606723,47.169640,0 27.607437,47.169487,0 27.608129,47.169292,0 27.608794,47.169057,0 27.609426,47.168783,0 27.610020,47.168473,0 27.610573,47.168129,0 27.611079,47.167753,0 27.611535,47.167349,0 27.611937,47.166920,0 27.612283,47.166468,0 27.612570,47.165997,0 27.612795,47.165511,0 27.612958,47.165014,0 27.613055,47.164509,0 27.613088,47.164000,0 27.613055,47.163491,0 27.612958,47.162986,0 27.612795,47.162489,0 27.612570,47.162003,0 27.612283,47.161532,0 27.611937,47.161080,0 27.611535,47.160651,0 27.611079,47.160247,0 27.610573,47.159871,0 27.610020,47.159527,0 27.609426,47.159217,0 27.608794,47.158943,0 27.608129,47.158708,0 27.607437,47.158513,0 27.606723,47.158360,0 27.605991,47.158250,0 27.605248,47.158183,0 27.604500,47.158161,0 27.603752,47.158183,0 27.603009,47.158250,0 27.602277,47.158360,0 27.601563,47.158513,0 27.600871,47.158708,0 27.600206,47.158943,0 27.599574,47.159217,0 27.598980,47.159527,0 27.598427,47.159871,0 27.597921,47.160247,0 27.597465,47.160651,0 27.597063,47.161080,0 27.596717,47.161532,0 27.596430,47.162003,0 27.596205,47.162489,0 27.596042,47.162986,0 27.595945,47.163491,0 27.595912,47.164000,0 27.595945,47.164509,0 27.596042,47.165014,0 27.596205,47.165511,0 27.596430,47.165997,0 27.596717,47.166468,0 27.597063,47.166920,0 27.597465,47.167349,0 27.597921,47.167753,0 27.598427,47.168129,0 27.598980,47.168473,0 27.599574,47.168783,0 27.600206,47.169057,0 27.600871,47.169292,0 27.601563,47.169487,0 27.602277,47.169640,0 27.603009,47.169750,0 27.603752,47.169817,0 27.604500,47.169839,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
