<Placemark><name>Sábado — Podu Roș e Piața Nicolina</name><description><![CDATA[09h30–13h00 · ≈ 3–4 km a pé dentro da zona · Elétrico até Podu Roș (~3 km)
Ruas: Podu Roș, Bd. Nicolae Iorga, Piața Nicolina (mercado) e ruas à volta
Alvos: Bancas e lojas do mercado com marca própria (mel, queijo, charcutaria), Padarias e pastelarias, Floristas, Take-away
Sábado de manhã o mercado está cheio e os donos estão lá. Só cartão e conversa curta — nada de demos longas.]]></description><styleUrl>#s5</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>27.593000,47.152839,0 27.593748,47.152817,0 27.594491,47.152750,0 27.595222,47.152640,0 27.595936,47.152487,0 27.596628,47.152292,0 27.597293,47.152057,0 27.597924,47.151783,0 27.598519,47.151473,0 27.599071,47.151129,0 27.599577,47.150753,0 27.600033,47.150349,0 27.600435,47.149920,0 27.600781,47.149468,0 27.601068,47.148997,0 27.601293,47.148511,0 27.601455,47.148014,0 27.601553,47.147509,0 27.601585,47.147000,0 27.601553,47.146491,0 27.601455,47.145986,0 27.601293,47.145489,0 27.601068,47.145003,0 27.600781,47.144532,0 27.600435,47.144080,0 27.600033,47.143651,0 27.599577,47.143247,0 27.599071,47.142871,0 27.598519,47.142527,0 27.597924,47.142217,0 27.597293,47.141943,0 27.596628,47.141708,0 27.595936,47.141513,0 27.595222,47.141360,0 27.594491,47.141250,0 27.593748,47.141183,0 27.593000,47.141161,0 27.592252,47.141183,0 27.591509,47.141250,0 27.590778,47.141360,0 27.590064,47.141513,0 27.589372,47.141708,0 27.588707,47.141943,0 27.588076,47.142217,0 27.587481,47.142527,0 27.586929,47.142871,0 27.586423,47.143247,0 27.585967,47.143651,0 27.585565,47.144080,0 27.585219,47.144532,0 27.584932,47.145003,0 27.584707,47.145489,0 27.584545,47.145986,0 27.584447,47.146491,0 27.584415,47.147000,0 27.584447,47.147509,0 27.584545,47.148014,0 27.584707,47.148511,0 27.584932,47.148997,0 27.585219,47.149468,0 27.585565,47.149920,0 27.585967,47.150349,0 27.586423,47.150753,0 27.586929,47.151129,0 27.587481,47.151473,0 27.588076,47.151783,0 27.588707,47.152057,0 27.589372,47.152292,0 27.590064,47.152487,0 27.590778,47.152640,0 27.591509,47.152750,0 27.592252,47.152817,0 27.593000,47.152839,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
